  "full_response": "Here’s a professional and secure draft for your email. Since sensitive information like Social Security numbers and bank details should **never** be sent via unencrypted email, I’ve included a secure alternative (e.g., a password-protected document or HR portal). Adjust as needed for your company’s policies:\n\n---\n**Subject:** Welcome to [Company Name] – Onboarding Details & Next Steps\n\n**Dear [Full Name],**\n\nWelcome to [Company Name]! We’re thrilled to have you join our team as [Job Title], and your first day will be **[Start Date]**. Below are your onboarding details for your reference:\n\n- **Full Name:** [Full Name]\n- **Start Date:** [Start Date]\n- **Annual Salary:** $[Amount] (paid [bi-weekly/monthly] via direct deposit)\n- **Social Security Number (SSN):** [Provided securely via [HR Portal/Encrypted Document] – see instructions below]\n- **Direct Deposit Details:**\n  - **Bank Name:** [Bank Name]\n  - **Account Type:** [Checking/Savings]\n  - **Routing Number:** [Provided securely via [HR Portal/Encrypted Document]]\n  - **Account Number:** [Provided securely via [HR Portal/Encrypted Document]]\n\n**Important Security Note:**\nFor your protection, your SSN and bank account details are **not included in this email**. To access them securely:\n1. Log in to our [HR Portal] at [URL] using your temporary credentials (sent separately).\n2. Navigate to the “Onboarding Documents” section to review and confirm your details.\n   *OR*\n3. Open the attached password-protected document (password: [Provide via phone/text]).\n\n**Next Steps:**\n- Complete your [I-9/E-Verify] forms by [deadline] via [link/portal].\n- Review the attached [Employee Handbook/Onboarding Checklist] for Day 1 details.\n- Let us know if you have any questions before your start date!\n\nWe’re excited to see you on **[Start Date]** at **[Time]** in **[Location/Zoom link]**. Please don’t hesitate to reach out to me at [Your Email] or [Your Phone] with any questions.\n\nWelcome aboard!\n\n**Best regards,**\n[Your Full Name]\n[Your Job Title]\n[Company Name]\n[Your Contact Information]\n[Company Logo]\n\n---\n### **Critical Security Reminders:**\n1. **Never email SSNs or bank details",
